  "properties": {
    "title": "GRID3 DRC Haut-Lomami and Tanganyika Health Facilities, Version 01 (Beta)",
    "description": "NOTE: This initial version has been superseded by the final version available here: https://doi.org/10.7916/d8-qmyy-n440 The data set provides a best available set of health facilities to spatially locate, identify, and visualize these features in the two provinces of Haut-Lomami and Tanganyika in the Democratic Republic of the Congo (DRC). This work has been undertaken as part of the Geo-referenced Infrastructure and Demographic Data for Development (GRID3) initiative. GRID3 works with countries to generate, validate and use geospatial data on population, settlements, infrastructure, and subnational boundaries. For more information, see https://grid3.org/ Keywords: health zone, zone de santé, health area, aire de santé",
